# Odyssey is licensed Tiket type and this repository may end up mirrored somewhere
# public, so no font binary is ever committed — not the drop in `tds library/tds font/`,
# and not the woff2 that `pnpm fonts:build` generates from it. Anyone who needs the real
# typeface builds it from their own copy of the drop; everyone else gets the system-font
# fallback, which is deliberate. See packages/fonts/README.md.
#
# This matters most for `tds library/`: the icons in there are committed, so an
# unqualified `git add` on that directory would otherwise pick the fonts up with them.
*.ttf
*.otf
*.woff
*.woff2
